    "Even in spread display, images whose width divided by height is at or above this value are shown as a single page. The default is 1.00 (square or wider images are shown singly). A larger value means only wider images are shown singly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Even in spread display, images whose width divided by height is at or above this value are shown as a single page. The default is 1.00 (square or wider images are shown singly). A larger value means only wider images are shown singly."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "見開き表示中でも、幅を高さで割った値がこの値以上の画像は単ページ表示にします。既定は1.00(正方形以上の横長画像を単ページ表示)です。値を大きくするほど、より横に長い画像だけが単ページ表示の対象になります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
