    "In a sandboxed app, qooViewer can only access files and folders you've explicitly selected. Granting access to a folder here — such as your home folder, an external volume, or a drive's root — lets features like same-folder browsing and previous/next book navigation work across that whole folder, even when you open a single archive file directly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In a sandboxed app, qooViewer can only access files and folders you've explicitly selected. Granting access to a folder here — such as your home folder, an external volume, or a drive's root — lets features like same-folder browsing and previous/next book navigation work across that whole folder, even when you open a single archive file directly."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サンドボックス化されたアプリでは、明示的に選択したファイル/フォルダにしかアクセスできません。ここでフォルダへのアクセスを許可しておくと(ホームフォルダ、外部ボリューム、ドライブのルートなど)、個別のアーカイブファイルを直接開いた場合でも、そのフォルダ全体で「同じフォルダのファイルを開く」や「前の本/次の本」などの機能が正しく動作するようになります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
